Description: installer for a classic Grafioschtrader installation
 Provides the command gt-install, the bootstrap installer of Grafioschtrader for Debian and Ubuntu. It inventories
 the host, asks for the installation choices, shows the complete plan and installs the database, toolchains,
 application, web server and TLS only after the administrator approves that plan.
 .
 Installing or upgrading this package never runs the installation, and removing it leaves an installed
 Grafioschtrader with its database and configuration in place. Start the installation with "sudo gt-install".

